&lt;h2>Overview&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="overview">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#overview" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;p>Plugin for the &lt;strong>Fooyin&lt;/strong> audio player displaying an &lt;strong>infinite scrolling mosaic of album covers&lt;/strong> with animations — cyclic browsing through the whole collection.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2>Features&lt;span class="hx-absolute -hx-mt-20" id="features">&lt;/span>
&lt;a href="#features" class="subheading-anchor" aria-label="Permalink for this section">&lt;/a>&lt;/h2>&lt;ul>
&lt;li>Infinite cyclic grid with adaptive cell size&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Efficient loading via Fooyin&amp;rsquo;s shared &lt;code>CoverRepository&lt;/code>&lt;/li>
&lt;li>&lt;strong>5 animations&lt;/strong>: 3D flip, crossfade, slide, zoom, page curl (+ random mode, 3 speeds)&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Configurable column count and background color&lt;/li>
&lt;li>Elegant placeholder for albums without covers&lt;/li>
&lt;/ul>
